| s_axi_control | GIER              | 0x04   | 32    | RW     | Global Interrupt Enable Register | 0=Enable                                                             |
| s_axi_control | IP_IER            | 0x08   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Enable Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_EN 1=CHAN1_INT_EN                                        |
| s_axi_control | IP_ISR            | 0x0c   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Status Register     | 0=CHAN0_INT_ST 1=CHAN1_INT_ST                                        |
| s_axi_control | ap_return         | 0x10   | 32    | R      | Data signal of ap_return         |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | image_r           | 0x18   | 32    | W      | Data signal of image_r           |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | blurred           | 0x20   | 32    | W      | Data signal of blurred           |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | resized           | 0x28   | 32    | W      | Data signal of resized           |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | selected          | 0x30   | 32    | W      | Data signal of selected          |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | result            | 0x38   | 32    | W      | Data signal of result            |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | stats             | 0x40   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stats             |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | level             | 0x48   | 32    | W      | Data signal of level             |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | budget            | 0x50   | 32    | W      | Data signal of budget            |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | high_threshold    | 0x58   | 32    | W      | Data signal of high_threshold    |                                                                      |
